	// **A FLY-OUT, NOT A SECOND TOP-LEVEL MENU, AND THAT IS THE BUG FIX** (Tom, 2026-08-18: 'Help >
	// "What the toolbar icons mean" does nothing'). It did nothing for a precise reason worth
